# Version and Milestone Rules

## Objective
Make development traceable and reversible.

## Versioning

- use semantic versioning for harness evolution
- create snapshot notes after any meaningful architecture change

## Milestones

- every milestone needs acceptance criteria
- every milestone needs validation gates
- every milestone needs a version tag

## Required records

For each snapshot or milestone:

- identifier
- timestamp
- summary of changes
- validation result
- rollback note

## Progress rule

Do not move to the next milestone unless the current one is validated.

